    "head_branch": "feature/hp-and-cooldown-in-store",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(store): hp and attack cooldown in the unit store (spec 35 step 5b)\n\nMoves hp, attack cooldown and regeneration left off SkirmishUnit into\nthe unit store's columns, on both backends. Every hp write goes through\nUnitHealth, which puts a unit taken from above 0 to 0 or below on the\nstore's fell queue; check_one_health.py holds that. FormationDeaths.bury\ndrains the queue instead of scanning every living unit, taking the\nfallen in squad-list then unit-list order, so outcomes and events stay\nas they were (Decision 145). Passes over many units fetch the columns\nonce and commit once.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AJNgLjKGfXvWBk1kZCVSV7",
